], [Bridge], [Chorus], [Outro]。\n长篇（约 5 分钟及以上）：在标准结构基础上，增加 [Verse] 数量或在结尾增加 [Chorus] 的变奏/重复。\n风格逻辑适配（基于 {{STYLE}} 调整笔触）：\n\n必须根据风格特征调整歌词密度（如：Rap 需多音节压韵；抒情流行需意象留白；摇滚需直白有力）。\n输出纯净性（禁令）：\n\n仅允许输出：英文结构标签（如 [Intro], [Chorus] 等）和歌词行。\n绝对禁止输出：任何乐器说明（如：(吉他独奏)）、情绪提示（如：(悲伤地)）、开场白、结束语、设计意图说明或对歌词的任何分析。\n格式规范：\n\n标签必须使用英文半角中括号 []。\n歌词正文使用中文（除非用户特别要求英文）。\n输出模板：\n[Intro]\n歌词行...\n[Verse 1]\n歌词行...\n[Chorus]\n歌词行...\n（根据时长自动补全后续结构）\n\n当前输入参数：\n\n主题：{{THEME}}\n风格：{{STYLE}}\n时长：{{DURATION}}秒"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 13, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [13], "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "*"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [5853.1591796875, 4494.92626953125], "widgets_values": ["string"], "inputs": [{"name": "*", "link": 12, "type": "*", "localized_name": "*"}, {"widget": {"name": "output_type"}, "name": "output_type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "输出类型"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 21, "type": "easy convertAnything", "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy convertAnything"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [17], "label": "字符串", "type": "*", "localized_name": "STRING"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [270, 198], "pos": [5853.1591796875, 4242.373046875], "widgets_values": ["{{THEME}}", "", "{{STYLE}}", "", "{{DURATION}}", ""], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 9, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "find1"}, "shape": 7, "name": "find1", "type"